# Keep build contexts small and reproducible. The Dockerfiles build from the repo root so pnpm can resolve
# the whole workspace, but none of the following belong in an image layer. No em dashes.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
**/*.log

# Local env and secrets must never enter an image. .env.example is the only env file that is allowed in,
# and it carries names only, never values; it is not needed at build time either, so it is excluded too.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# VCS and CI metadata
.git
.github

# Editor and OS cruft
.DS_Store
**/coverage

# Test SOURCE files are not needed in a runtime image. We exclude the test files themselves, but NOT the
# package directories: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile needs every workspace member's package.json present
# (pnpm-workspace.yaml includes tests/*), so excluding the whole tests/ dir breaks the workspace install.
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
